      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're using the context of the movie to make a cosmic analogy, highlighting the paradoxical nature of existence. By accepting the void, you're essentially taking a shortcut to freedom from the expectations and obligations that come with a meaningful perspective. It's a radical act of throwing away the script that's been supporting your life, and choosing to walk out of the theater at the very beginning, when the words haven't yet changed.",
      "source": "target",
